Recipe (case-sensitive work root; the lane writes libc-reference.a there):
  python3 tools/ladder/musl.py --evocc EVOCC --build .build/case/m1 --no-receipt
  python3 tools/ladder/musl_patched.py --suite wordexp --evocc EVOCC \
    --build .build/case/m1 --output OUT
Add --patch PREVIOUS.patch or --unpatched-control for the two RED replays.
The NOCMD and differential harnesses run in the sealed image against the
patched wordexp.c; adversarial/run.sh shows the exact commands.
